{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aa89f24124753f26a9b65859740518efedb76074d7f8b1f96f43190cd9440e6f", "ja": "お疲れジュリア！　最高のステージだった！\nやっぱりすごいな、ジュリアの歌は……。", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚！你的表演简直棒到极点！\n茱莉亚的歌声果然很不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "7504d1f6d5df0269adefb6630fbe08aaaf3f40794602903c9a0a7aebd8481ebd", "ja": "へへ、サンキュ、{$P$}。今回の\nライブは自分でも驚くくらい、気分がのったんだ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢啦，{$P$}。这次演唱会，\n我兴致高昂得连自己都有点吓到呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "94b0e4606faa67df4deee13c24bb9b1d32a34d1aa8af3f9ffc4b8a4bad9201bd", "ja": "今も、なんだか体がふわふわしちまってる。\nもうしばらく、この感覚にひたっていたいな……。", "zh": "直到现在我都还觉得身体轻飘飘的。\n真想继续沉浸在这种感觉之中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "544d075b60dda9a98d111f0cdcd54c95b94ad2a533358727127e32e4d63cafae", "ja": "かまわないよ。\n客席のファンの皆も、まだ帰りたくないみたいだし。", "zh": "无所谓啊。\n观众席的粉丝们看来也还不想回家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "0ebc91b97065d36ed0ea03761f12c139624f35f5773cad8af27e145c37c12cc2", "ja": "ふふっ……、みんな、同じ気持ちなのかな……。", "zh": "呵呵……大家的心情都一样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "ba7c025e0fa8913d570f828ec2b03af014041060f85f8be031c0ad1b0ab6a52c", "ja": "……あのさ、もしもあたしが、本当に\n魔法使いになりたいんだって言ったら、笑うか？", "zh": "……我问你，如果我说我真的想成为魔法使，\n你会笑我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "21a900640d1e4fc68d015376e97528c304447976e4aa2f2ac406b26e813ece33", "ja": "ジュリアが、魔法使いに？", "zh": "茱莉亚想当魔法使？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "b050047e053b599090a66c9eb52c1bd9e05c877f3d75ce46dab609cef79da07a", "ja": "ああ。不思議な力で、奇跡を起こすのが魔法使いだろ？\n実際、歌だって、魔法みたいなもんだと思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯，魔法使﻿会用不可思议的力量来引发奇迹，对吧？\n实际上，我觉得歌也是跟魔法一样的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "c0dcb9079a2527ca4d1529137cbb062332ddc7912b70649aee4ea6c7039792e7", "ja": "聞いてる人の心を少しでも変えることができれば、\n奇跡ってやつが、本当に起きたってことじゃないかな？", "zh": "只要能让听众的心多少产生变化，\n那也算是真的发生了奇迹吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "856f5c5a45fd9f6a2d6138c71a1e363174248702e6bb347b938aba72f982c46f", "ja": "そうかもな……。でもそれなら、歌で人を感動させ\nられるジュリアは、既に魔法使いなんじゃないか？", "zh": "或许吧……不过这样的话，\n能用歌声感动人心的茱莉亚，不就已经是魔法使﻿了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "98b73c005c90abedaca61f85beed8cbec58843d2ccd78b9fd14594ced089ac13", "ja": "いや、あたしなんてまだまだこれからさ。よくて魔法\n使いの弟子……。それは自分が一番よくわかってる。", "zh": "不，我还差得远了。\n顶多算是魔法使﻿的徒弟……这我自己最清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "4cd31fd69bab32a6c8a731b77d657faa85f67480077e5716b422f0f20c66c29e", "ja": "だけど……あたしは本物の魔法使いを知ってるよ。", "zh": "不过……我倒是认识真正的魔法使喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b6ed1aedb40525d8bca6578eb212aafbc18579c39df8f151bebb0bc0d4d2147a", "ja": "へえ、ジュリアが認めてる人っていうと……。\n海外のバンドとか、ミュージシャンか？", "zh": "哦，受到茱莉亚认可的人……\n会是国外的乐团，或是音乐家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "4ad4f953a23f96ece20f826e9206c15d7cdcc82f0ddad5bd81ceed3cfeca5c6c", "ja": "知りたいか？　ふふっ、\nそれはあんただよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "想知道吗？\n呵呵，那就是你啊，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "64000804371eb18338dcfd5335ce928f7a3eb659c2c91ffada7b0dcf4d718706", "ja": "あんたは歌いもしないくせに、あたしの心を、\nいつだって良い方に変える。", "zh": "明明连歌也不会唱，\n你却总是能让我的心产生正向的改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "34c537277060683e52445fee71841f243a982864b6351233b66f05dc3d437f50", "ja": "あたしをここに導いてくれたあんたこそ、\n本物の魔法使いだよ！", "zh": "引领我走到现在这一步的你，\n才是真正的魔法使啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1016_p", "source_sha256": "98b7e3ed3432d5db0d632484b60babd3f79a0e6ed9f704205a78209306e4ca4d", "ja": "ジュリア……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0034_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "7ae38693b7ec7c98f4cbb47c0ff5b0879465ee48fd97e2ef95218698ca733eaf", "ja": "ってことで……これからもよろしく頼むぜ、\nあたしの魔法使いさん。", "zh": "所以说……以后也请多指教啰，\n我的魔法使先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
